# T2c review item 4: the raised 303 keyboard path (REC + a key on the GLOBAL page) must not
# leave a held note when the view changes. Before the fix, the note started by bass_kbd bypassed
# the held-note table, so the LFO view change released nothing and the note hung.
tap EDIT
turn ALGO 2 114
tap REC
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
tap GLO
key 17 down
wait 50
tap LFO
wait 50
key 17 up
wait 3000
expect voices 0
